## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to build an **LSTM-based multi-class classification model** using TensorFlow and Keras to predict signal quality from network measurements.

The workflow includes:

* 📂 Data Loading
* 🧹 Data Preprocessing
* 🏷️ Label Encoding
* 📊 Feature Scaling
* 🔄 Sequence Generation for LSTM
* 🤖 Model Training
* 📈 Model Evaluation
* 📉 Training & Validation Visualization

